            ^"Activities in the past 15 years" STRING "Eight years were spent learning and seven years in the lab, creating many items for his wife. The spells Blessing of Artemis’ Fertility, Incantation of the Warriors Made Whole, Bestow the Blessing of Apollon, Ears of a Grateful Father, Housearrest of the Unruly Child, It’s Raining Men, and Parental Inquisitiveness were invented. The items Bachelor’s Door, Army of the Infant, Bed of Rapid Convalescence, Comb of Aphrodite, Crib with a Mother’s Touch, Guardian of Decency, Nappy without Nuisance, Traveller’s Comfort, and Soothe the Mother’s Anxiety were created. Two additional seasons of work are needed for the spells, so the above mentioned workload was made in 15 years and two seasons."
            ^"Source" STRING "Magi of Hermes"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 18
        }
    }

